OL,3,AArgentina threatens legal action
OL,4,Aagainst UK over Falkland Islands oil
OL,5,Aexploration
OL,6,
OL,7,FArgentina's president has threatened to
OL,8,Flaunch a legal challenge against the
OL,9,FBritish government unless it halts oil
OL,10,Fexploration work off the coast of the
OL,11,FFalkland Islands.
OL,13,FIn a social media post, President
OL,14,FJavier Milei set a two-week deadline
OL,15,Ffor the Sea Lion oilfield project, a
OL,16,Fjoint venture between Israeli and
OL,17,FBritish companies, to be scrapped.
OL,19,FThe companies insist they have valid
OL,20,Flicences issued by Britain.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
